{"id":"660415","name":"五花肉苦瓜煲","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660415/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄豆提前泡发备用。","img":"images/660415/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菇泡发备用。","img":"images/660415/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"五花肉去皮洗净切片。","img":"images/660415/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"苦瓜去籽洗净切块。","img":"images/660415/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入五花肉。","img":"images/660415/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煸炒出油脂。","img":"images/660415/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入香菇炒出香味。","img":"images/660415/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入苦瓜。","img":"images/660415/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀后转入高压锅中。","img":"images/660415/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入黄豆。","img":"images/660415/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐。","img":"images/660415/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/660415/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"高压锅20至30分钟左右即可。","img":"images/660415/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660415/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660415/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660415/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}